      "id": "claim_8252dedc8ee24375855dc12f080b843c",
      "statement": "FrozenArmMixin applies the uniform frozen-arm prep (eval + requires_grad_(False)) at construction via `_register_frozen_arm(name, arm)` and registers the arm as a normal `nn.Module` submodule so Lightning's automatic `.to(device)` owns its placement; the mixin then keeps the arm off the checkpoint via a prefix-aware `state_dict()` override (mutating the shared destination in place) and off strict load via a frozen-arm allow-list (any missing/unexpected trainable key still raises with `RuntimeError(\"missing\" / \"unexpected\")`, never a blanket `strict=False`).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/modules/frozen_arm.py#L52-L137",
