      "statement": "Source-level guards via `inspect.getsource` in `tests/test_device_policy.py` and `tests/test_ddp_warm.py` lock the DevicePolicy wiring: `grpo_cli.main` and `reward_cli.main` construct `DevicePolicy` and call `.pin()` with no inline `set_device` (ADR-0035 T2); `controlnet_cli.main` calls `DevicePolicy().pin()` and no longer resolves a bare `torch.device(\"cuda\")` (ADR-0035 T3 / PR #156); the JiT `_warm_data` and the controlnet `_real_inputs` warm closures call `DevicePolicy().warm_device(...)` and never reference `resolve_warm_device` (ADR-0035 T4 / T5).",
